// an interest; EPOLL_CTL_DEL for none. Interest 4 is EPOLLEXCLUSIVE: of the
// processes watching one descriptor, a readiness wakes one rather than all,
// which is how forked workers share a listener without every worker racing
// for each connection. The kernel refuses it on a MOD, so a watch that
// changes to or from it goes through an unwatch first.
